Comprehensive update of all School Management System (SMS) classes to ensure 100% alignment between the design schema and the functional implementation.

1. Academics & Operations Updates:
   - GradesManager: Implemented Upsert logic for 'save_grade', transcript extraction, and exam statistics.
   - AttendanceManager: Added "Call Sheet" logic, absence justification workflows, and per-student attendance analytics.
   - SchedulesManager: Integrated Smart Conflict Check for room/teacher availability and weekly schedule retrieval.

