   - UserTransactionsManager: Enabled peer-to-peer transfers, account statement (Statement) generation, and transaction status tracking.
   - StudentFeesManager: Implemented debt management, net-amount calculations (after discounts), and overdue tracking.
   - PaymentsManager: Added automated receipt generation and balance tracking per invoice.

3. System & Communications Overhaul:
   - Database (Singleton): Documented Singleton architecture, connection handling, and password-protected "Hard Reset" logic.
   - MessagesManager: Enabled peer-to-peer messaging, full conversation retrieval, and Inbox management.
   - NotificationsManager: Added support for Bulk sending, read/unread tracking, and periodic cleanup of legacy notifications.
   - PostsManager: Updated with Blog/News posting capabilities, author-linking, and dynamic image/content editing.

4. Structural & Architectural Fixes:
   - ENUM Removal: Converted all ENUM fields to VARCHAR/String handling via 'VALID_STATUSES' for easier maintenance.
   - Relations & Joins: Optimized Read methods to perform SQL JOINs with Users/Students/Teachers tables to retrieve full names instead of raw IDs.
   - Standard Compliance: Enforced relative paths and 24K gold base calculations as per system mandates.
